              "id": "0b13db95-e847-4bc0-9c3e-fd060bc94b8b",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em><strong>Nested Games: Rational Choice in Comparative Politics</strong></em> was written by George Tsebelis, published by University of California Press, August 12, 1991."
